{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be8ab53-db0e-11ef-9889-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"龍山","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"慕容廆","people_name_jianti_auto":"慕容廆","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a0b941dc-db0e-11ef-b349-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐國郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐国郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a0b941dd-db0e-11ef-9d9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"慕容廆置唐國郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"慕容廆置唐国郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a0b941db-db0e-11ef-bd74-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"柳城","place_name_jianti_auto":"柳城","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a0b941df-db0e-11ef-8e26-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙城县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a0b941e0-db0e-11ef-a0e5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"由此改柳城爲龍城縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"由此改柳城为龙城县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"a0b941de-db0e-11ef-ba55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","resolved_place_entity_id":3517,"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a0ba0803-db0e-11ef-b20c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，东破高丽[咸康四年，击高句丽，入丸都，毁其城而还]，北...","context_before":"...令支，灭段氏，以皝不会，赵兵自专其利，移兵击皝，败去]，","source_end_index":618,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1cb48bc4-3d2c-5e61-af63-c13b19cd5c8e","source_start_index":598,"source_text":"迁都龙城[即柳城也。皝更营之，号曰龙城]"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/三、晋 十六国（卷三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"永和六年，慕容儁迁于蓟。八年，建留台于龙都，即龙城也。隆...","context_before":"...。战国属燕。秦汉及晋俱属辽西郡。晋建兴以后，属于慕容氏。","source_end_index":174,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"15865604-9c1d-5e8e-a417-0500466bc9b0","source_start_index":112,"source_text":"咸康七年，慕容皝以柳城之北、龙山之西，为福德之地，乃营制宫庙，改柳城为龙城。八年，遂迁都焉。寻号新宫曰和龙宫，宫门曰弘光门。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，燕王皝使唐國內史陽裕等築城於柳城之北，龍山之西，立宗廟、宮闕，命曰龍城。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月，前燕主慕容皝派遣唐国内史阳裕等人在柳城以北、龙山以西修筑城郭，设立宗庙、宫阙，命名为龙城。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，燕王皝使唐国内史阳裕等筑城于柳城之北，龙山之西，立宗庙、宫阙，命曰龙城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8323,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第九十六 (晉紀十八) / 顯宗成皇帝中之下 / 七年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a0b941da-db0e-11ef-bf93-a0d3651f611f","year_int":341},"tongjian_id":"a0b941da-db0e-11ef-bf93-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"龍山","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a153384b-db0e-11ef-947a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍城","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙城","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"a153384c-db0e-11ef-872b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"龍山在龍城之東。見，賢遍翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"龙山在龙城之东。见，贤遍翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a151bac4-db0e-11ef-b403-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","resolved_place_entity_id":3517,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a153384e-db0e-11ef-82ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"○安萝山，或云在营州东南。唐贞观十八年，伐高丽，诸军大集...","context_before":"龙山[在营州东。","source_end_index":69,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ee9851f8-79af-5512-bd79-49de2a969b37","source_start_index":8,"source_text":"燕慕容皝时，有黑白三龙斗于此，皝率僚属观之，祭以太牢，二龙交首嬉戏解角而去，因名。其宫曰和龙，以柳城为和龙城，山亦曰龙山。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5燕有黑龍、白龍見于龍山，交首遊戲，解角而去。燕王皝親祀以太牢，赦其境內，命所居新宮曰和龍。","content_fanyi":"前燕有黑龙和白龙出现在龙山，两龙交首嬉戏，丢下龙角后离去。前燕王慕容皝亲自用太牢之礼祭祀，赦免境内罪犯，并将自己居住的新宫殿命名为和龙。","content_jianti_auto":"5燕有黑龙、白龙见于龙山，交首游戏，解角而去。燕王皝亲祀以太牢，赦其境内，命所居新宫曰和龙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8398,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第九十七 (晉紀十九) / 孝宗穆皇帝上之上 / 永和元年 / 第 7 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a151bac3-db0e-11ef-8058-a0d3651f611f","year_int":345},"tongjian_id":"a151bac3-db0e-11ef-8058-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"龍山","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"江寧府","place_name_jianti_auto":"江宁府","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a9473bcc-db0e-11ef-b287-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a9473bcd-db0e-11ef-aa8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江寧府","place_name_jianti_auto":"江宁府","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a9473bce-db0e-11ef-8715-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建康","place_name_jianti_auto":"建康","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a9473bcf-db0e-11ef-a8b5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"九域志：江寧府有龍山，山形似龍。江寧府卽建康。","note_content_jianti_auto":"九域志：江宁府有龙山，山形似龙。江宁府即建康。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a9473bcb-db0e-11ef-ba56-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"亡，逃亡也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"亡，逃亡也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd1-db0e-11ef-ac1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"薄太后","people_name_jianti_auto":"薄太后","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd3-db0e-11ef-bc41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd4-db0e-11ef-8285-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鉤弋夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"钩弋夫人","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd5-db0e-11ef-9a4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭帝","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd6-db0e-11ef-8e23-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉氏","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd7-db0e-11ef-b1d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古者，宗廟之制，妾祔於妾祖姑。漢氏以來，薄太后生文帝，鉤弋夫人生昭帝，皆就園置寢廟，未嘗別立廟也。史言帝溺於女寵，縱情敗禮。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"古者，宗庙之制，妾祔于妾祖姑。汉氏以来，薄太后生文帝，钩弋夫人生昭帝，皆就园置寝庙，未尝别立庙也。史言帝溺于女宠，纵情败礼。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd2-db0e-11ef-b3bd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","resolved_place_entity_id":3518,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"a9473bd9-db0e-11ef-8d43-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"武帝景宁陵亦在焉。又明帝泰始七年，射雉岩山，杀其弟休祐，...","context_before":"...周十五里，高七十一丈。吴天纪初，尝立石刻于山上，纪功德。","source_end_index":234,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6cf99d54-eb9e-5acf-88c7-2976f4bd079c","source_start_index":203,"source_text":"刘宋大明六年，葬殷贵妃于龙山，凿冈道数十里，时改岩山为龙山也。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"16冬，十月，壬申，葬宣貴妃於龍山。鑿岡通道數十里，民不堪役，死亡甚衆；自江南葬埋之盛，未之有也。又爲之別立廟。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月二十五日壬申，刘宋孝武帝将宣贵妃安葬在龙山。在山上开凿了数十里山路，百姓忍受不了劳役，死亡、逃走的人很多；自江南有葬礼以来，还从未有过如此盛大的葬礼。又为宣贵妃另建了一座祭庙。","content_jianti_auto":"16冬，十月，壬申，葬宣贵妃于龙山。凿冈通道数十里，民不堪役，死亡甚众；自江南葬埋之盛，未之有也。又为之别立庙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":12087,"number":16,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百二十九 (宋紀十一) / 世祖孝武皇帝下 / 六年 / 第 17 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a9473bca-db0e-11ef-b87f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":462},"tongjian_id":"a9473bca-db0e-11ef-b87f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"龍山","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"關，白也。說，輸芮翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"关，白也。说，输芮翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b5e8bd4f-db0e-11ef-b056-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"斌廉","people_name_jianti_auto":"斌廉","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a4-db0e-11ef-8dd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a5-db0e-11ef-b1a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍山縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a6-db0e-11ef-b5eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太原郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"太原郡","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a7-db0e-11ef-b35b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋阳","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a8-db0e-11ef-854b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b5e902a9-db0e-11ef-9664-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按隋志，後齊置龍山縣，帶太原郡，開皇十年改曰晉陽。則此時不復有龍山矣，豈斌廉在開皇中嘗爲令史，以舊官書之邪？對博者，不勝者納物與勝者曰輸。斌，音彬。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按隋志，后齐置龙山县，带太原郡，开皇十年改曰晋阳。则此时不复有龙山矣，岂斌廉在开皇中尝为令史，以旧官书之邪？对博者，不胜者纳物与胜者曰输。斌，音彬。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"b5e8bd50-db0e-11ef-b624-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"龍山","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙山","resolved_place_entity_id":3519,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b5e902b4-db0e-11ef-9fbf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"淵與裴寂有舊，每相與宴語，或連日夜。文靜欲因寂關說，乃引寂與世民交。世民出私錢數百萬，使龍山令高斌廉與寂博，稍以輸之，寂大喜，由是日從世民遊，情款益狎。世民乃以其謀告之，寂許諾。","content_fanyi":"李渊与裴寂原本就有交情，彼此时常一同宴饮叙谈，有时连日连夜不歇。刘文静想请裴寂居中说动李渊，便引荐裴寂与李世民交往。李世民拿出私财数百万钱，让龙山令高斌廉与裴寂赌博，渐渐把钱输给他。裴寂非常高兴，从此每天跟着李世民游乐，情谊日益亲密。李世民这才把自己的谋划告诉裴寂，裴寂答应替他劝说李渊。","content_jianti_auto":"渊与裴寂有旧，每相与宴语，或连日夜。文静欲因寂关说，乃引寂与世民交。世民出私钱数百万，使龙山令高斌廉与寂博，稍以输之，寂大喜，由是日从世民游，情款益狎。世民乃以其谋告之，寂许诺。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17740,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十三 (隋紀七) / 恭皇帝上 / 義寧元年 / 第 28 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b5e8bd4e-db0e-11ef-80b3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":617},"tongjian_id":"b5e8bd4e-db0e-11ef-80b3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":4},"place_name":"龍山"},"message":"success","success":true}